#
# Why that sha and not the other candidate (refs/pr/37, resolved
# 600a3e1de158ae56dc82a5fab56c2ca25acb1e27):
#   * that revision carries an archive for every registered site (28 of 28), and
#     the kaggle seed DB it ships was found identical to the seed the site's own
